OL,3,GNEWSADid Scotland's departing chief
OL,4,Amedical officer actually do anything
OL,5,Awrong?
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Gregor Smith, who has resigned as
OL,8,FScotland's chief medical officer, was
OL,9,Fappointed to the role when his
OL,10,Fpredecessor quit for breaking Covid
OL,11,Frules.
OL,13,FHe leaves the position having become
OL,14,Fcaught up in a very different
OL,15,Fcontroversy.
OL,17,FSmith said he had taken a "personal
OL,18,Fdecision" to stand down because he did
OL,19,Fnot have the "good mental health"
OL,20,Fnecessary to continue.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
