OL,3,GNEWSADid Scotland's departing chief
OL,4,Amedical officer actually do anything
OL,5,Awrong?
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne government source suggested to me
OL,8,Fthat Smith had taken the right decision
OL,9,Fand that it was better than anyone
OL,10,Fhaving to ask him to go.
